{
  "evidenceCount": 28,
  "evidenceSpans": [
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-d2c36284",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0002",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "本办法所称商业汇票是出票人签发的，委托付款人在见票时或者在指定日期无条件支付确定的金额给收款人或者持票人的票据，包括但不限于纸质或电子形式的银行承兑汇票、财务公司承兑汇票、商业承兑汇票等。",
      "quoteHash": "d2c362847c3e4dbcdba9badc7e66a5ef1a031a7e1fe6771b49b954de24a9c252",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-b39717ae",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0003",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "电子商业汇票的出票、承兑、贴现、贴现前的背书、质押、保证、提示付款和追索等业务，应当通过人民银行认可的票据市场基础设施办理。供应链票据属于电子商业汇票。",
      "quoteHash": "b39717ae0564a7a90c6bff91338e27d5c7820505f09f700abffa59c1748edd7f",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-2c34b003",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0004",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第四条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "本办法所称承兑是指付款人承诺在商业汇票到期日无条件支付汇票金额的票据行为。",
      "quoteHash": "2c34b003c3a5bbdd1b084622ea06af884533f810c294d24f8456ee413b962fc6",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-6b3f5730",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0005",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第五条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "本办法所称贴现是指持票人在商业汇票到期日前，贴付一定利息将票据转让至具有贷款业务资质机构的行为。持票人持有的票据应为依法合规取得，具有真实交易关系和债权债务关系，因税收、继承、赠与依法无偿取得票据的除外。",
      "quoteHash": "6b3f5730f78e0c6919057cc594c2aaddb0abd483ef199f6c399fe7232bb8a6aa",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-06caa93e",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0007",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第七条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "商业汇票的承兑、贴现和再贴现，应当遵循依法合规、公平自愿、诚信自律、风险自担的原则。",
      "quoteHash": "06caa93e194fd74a6a50d99ad050d6d6a85ac86c472930c75d61dcc7815f1f80",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "RISK",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-f92f667f",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0011",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十一条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "银行、农村信用合作社、财务公司承兑人开展承兑业务时，应当严格审查出票人的真实交易关系和债权债务关系以及承兑风险，出票人应当具有良好资信。承兑的金额应当与真实交易关系和债权债务关系、承兑申请人的偿付能力相匹配。",
      "quoteHash": "f92f667fccb55f03c5f7d318650d99d473705a11bfd6e012178cfb780b86149d",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "RISK",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-6a5648f5",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0013",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "银行、农村信用合作社、财务公司承兑业务应当纳入存款类金融机构统一授信管理和风险管理框架。",
      "quoteHash": "6a5648f555b4252667ac9ffc4ff5e711ad7058392c36a4b0304f5cfcb0876f80",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-34f8506b",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0015",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十五条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "申请贴现的持票人取得贴现票据应依法合规，与出票人或前手之间具有真实交易关系和债权债务关系，因税收、继承、赠与依法无偿取得票据的除外。",
      "quoteHash": "34f8506b79e62241284f6764b16910f2dc001016eaf5264890070fb488970a7f",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-a67bf034",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0018",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十八条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "票据经纪机构应为市场信誉良好、票据业务活跃的金融机构。票据经纪机构应当具有独立的票据经纪部门和完善的内控管理机制，具有专门的经纪渠道，票据经纪业务与自营业务严格隔离。票据经纪机构应当具有专业的从业人员。",
      "quoteHash": "a67bf034f3c6bbaafad21c84c8c6efb94acbe509ece4ef918efc5ab7aa58e4de",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-e68df2aa",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0019",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十九条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "转贴现业务按照人民银行和银保监会票据交易有关规定执行。",
      "quoteHash": "e68df2aaf0bdf7f61795c90cbbb3e3cc9b481b33df05576667ba0e1fde7a741c",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-9a30faf3",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0020",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "办理商业汇票贴现业务的金融机构，可以申请办理再贴现业务。再贴现业务办理的条件、利率、期限和方式，按照人民银行有关规定执行。",
      "quoteHash": "9a30faf3d7f5f27c296cd1af3b902c4e162011af44fa176672c16782f57c9a5b",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "RISK",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-839b7754",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0021",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十一条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "金融机构应当具备健全的票据业务管理制度和内部控制制度，审慎开展商业汇票承兑和贴现业务，采取有效措施防范市场风险、信用风险和操作风险。",
      "quoteHash": "839b775493f4e4be4a55943de57fd5db5727f56f9c6e4aaa7d9926efbcb3623e",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-33abc80b",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0022",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十二条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "商业汇票的承兑人和贴现人应当具备良好的经营和财务状况，最近二年不得发生票据持续逾期或者未按规定披露信息的行为。商业汇票承兑人对承兑的票据应当具备到期付款的能力。",
      "quoteHash": "33abc80b39a78aa045a0778c334b6367fe07830656bec0da1cacc81156bd8d89",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-eccc131a",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0023",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "财务公司承兑人所属的集团法人应当具备良好的经营和财务状况，最近二年不得发生票据持续逾期或者未按规定披露信息的行为，最近二年不得发生重大违法行为，以及其他严重损害市场主体合法权益或社会公共利益的行为。",
      "quoteHash": "eccc131a473ef5e1740639e639146cf6faf8c313c8600680a73594f0576f7348",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-d25d7ec7",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0024",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十四条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "银行承兑汇票和财务公司承兑汇票的最高承兑余额不得超过该承兑人总资产的 15%。银行承兑汇票和财务公司承兑汇票保证金余额不得超过该承兑人吸收存款规模的 10%。人民银行和银保监会可以根据金融机构内控情况设置承兑余额与贷款余额比例上限等其他监管指标。",
      "quoteHash": "d25d7ec7b63ccc37bbc096770192f08763ad82d6032e311cf080c28b4be62ad4",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-7eb22005",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0026",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十六条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "商业汇票信息披露按照人民银行有关规定执行，应当遵循及时、真实、准确、完整的原则。",
      "quoteHash": "7eb22005d19a75b848201c17c78d73d1e76b57293919108b7c76f1ca2f2e24ec",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-d4c35d63",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0027",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十七条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "商业承兑汇票承兑人和财务公司承兑汇票承兑人应当按照人民银行规定披露票据主要要素及信用信息。银行承兑汇票承兑人应当披露承兑人信用信息。",
      "quoteHash": "d4c35d63bce71388f875e11f36a031e4a6af3447eb2155557beab8cf46ce6dbd",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-54469fe1",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0028",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十八条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "贴现人办理商业汇票贴现的，应当按照人民银行规定核对票据披露信息，信息不存在或者记载事项与披露信息不一致的，不得为持票人办理贴现。",
      "quoteHash": "54469fe1297bdd20887ffef56fda41830139f0de2cf0dd41743d062c38a657b4",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-b3ab3310",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0029",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十九条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "商业汇票背书转让时，被背书人可以按照人民银行规定核对票据信息，信息不存在或者记载事项与披露信息不一致的，可以采取有效措施识别票据信息真伪及信用风险，加强风险防范。",
      "quoteHash": "b3ab33104fc703c58674011179af8155ef44336288be5aaa90b30fb5b42411f1",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-f63eeea1",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0030",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "商业汇票承兑人为非上市公司、在债券市场无信用评级的，鼓励商业汇票流通前由信用评级机构对承兑人进行主体信用评级，并按照人民银行有关规定披露相关信息。",
      "quoteHash": "f63eeea132cf4833774a29509f73c2d390f719b3414f13e01d74af325f7e19c0",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "RISK",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-41c918fd",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0031",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十一条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "票据市场基础设施按人民银行有关要求对承兑人信息披露情况进行监测，承兑人存在票据持续逾期或披露信息存在虚假、遗漏、延迟的，票据市场基础设施应根据业务规则采取相应处置措施，并向人民银行报告。",
      "quoteHash": "41c918fd18da5b6ae99cd7828f6904ab2595746dcba980f60e80bea29e52f952",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "RISK",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-68b7a846",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0033",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "人民银行、银保监会按照法定职责对商业汇票的承兑、贴现、风险控制和信息披露进行监督管理。人民银行对再贴现进行监督管理。",
      "quoteHash": "68b7a846245641360d6986e98c865cd99080497fb28f72908fb2233e499bec0a",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-62e424d2",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0034",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十四条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "票据市场基础设施和办理商业汇票承兑、贴现、再贴现业务的主体，应当按规定和监管需要向人民银行和银保监会报送有关业务数据。",
      "quoteHash": "62e424d2f40c410f70c3b35c276d88be1ceec77b292834db173c1ad77ff94982",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-1ac73347",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0035",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十五条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "银行承兑汇票、财务公司承兑汇票的承兑限额、付款期限超出规定的，由人民银行及其分支机构、银保监会及其派出机构对承兑人进行警告、通报批评，并由银保监会及其派出机构依法处以罚款。",
      "quoteHash": "1ac733479e5c507323b08f18bf95856a1b79b5222ff3b546de45db997d5a325a",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-add46c3b",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0036",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十六条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "商业汇票承兑人最近二年发生票据持续逾期或者未按规定披露信息的，金融机构不得为其办理票据承兑、贴现、保证、质押等业务。",
      "quoteHash": "add46c3bac531da9d2cc35e8f1506d25acad99d5c2151799559adac4266d5a39",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-2c98f5e1",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0037",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十七条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "金融机构为不具有真实交易关系和债权债务关系（因税收、继承、赠与依法无偿取得票据的除外）的出票人、持票人办理商业汇票承兑、贴现的，由银保监会及其派出机构根据不同情形依法采取暂停其票据业务等监管措施或者实施行政处罚；对直接负责的董事、高级管理人员和其他直接责任人员，依法追究相关责任。",
      "quoteHash": "2c98f5e13a43c52f7bc60bdc894ca21a5e3b6f0a6f98eccd8dbd4d850bd4681f",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-e08951ba",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0039",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十九条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "未经依法许可或者违反国家金融管理规定，擅自从事票据贴现的，依照有关法律法规进行处置。",
      "quoteHash": "e08951ba03eaaf41bf6f40eb8ef164663de24ef5a04584266f0da5db4d70d82c",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF001-20260922-5aeaa4ae",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF001-5322c9cc",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF001-0041",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第四十一条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "本办法第二十四条规定自2024年1月1日起实施。",
      "quoteHash": "5322c9cc44fd85acf15fb4ae70c098fe06ee5b1dc0ab3a564d09599c3e773aa5",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "5aeaa4ae76deeac981ae385a0857dd07a5d80df0f1fb123ef575da895d0f7102",
